**Darwin:** Close 6 · Honest 7 · Smoke 4 · Entropy 4 · Ship 2 → **avg 4.6**  
**Why later:** Signature change across emit-lower/call. Does **not** fix 7.2 heap (already sliced). Architecture-adjacent; s71 I3 twin.

